   457                          ;HEX - Get hexadecimal constant.
   458                          ;   Inputs: ASCII string at (IY)
   459                          ;  Outputs: Integer result in H'L'HL, C=0, A7=0.
   460                          ;           IY updated (points to delimiter)
   461                          ;
   462  01ff  cd7809            HEX:	CALL	ZERO
   463  0202  cdd709            	CALL	HEXDIG
   464  0205  38ba              	JR	C,BADHEX
